PREDICTION: the three windows disagree over a band roughly 60 kbit/s .. 2 Mbit/s wide,
and they disagree in a fixed ORDER: window A (2 s, per edge) fails first, then window B
(3 s, the API DEFAULT), and window C (15 s, ?liveness=all) last. A flow that a human would
call 'steady and running' is absent from the default answer well before it is absent
from the table.
